[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0877","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0877.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59948","title":"Composer 依赖管理器任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Composer（PHP 依赖管理工具）在 2.2.29 及 2.10.2 之前版本中存在路径遍历导致的任意文件写入漏洞。当用户从非 Packagist.org 或 Private Packagist 的不可信第三方仓库安装依赖时，攻击者可通过发布包含恶意包名的软件包，利用 Composer 对包名校验不充分的缺陷，在 install 或 update 过程中将攻击者控制的内容写入 vendor/ 目录及项目目录之外的位置。攻击者可借此写入 shell 启动文件、SSH authorized_keys 或 cron 条目，实现供应链攻击场景下的远程代码执行。该漏洞需依赖图中存在恶意或已被攻破的软件包，无法直接远程利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59948","GHSA-499r-g7pc-vmp9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T20:16:59Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:14:18Z","remediation":"立即将 Composer 升级至 2.2.29 或 2.10.2 及以上版本：执行 `composer self-update 2.10.2` 完成升级。如无法升级，仅使用 Packagist.org 或 Private Packagist 作为包来源，禁止添加不受信任的第三方仓库源（`composer config repositories.xxx` 命令），并通过内部镜像仓库代理外部源以过滤恶意包名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/composer/composer/commit/502c6c4f699802d9cf464728b3e8a95674f919a0","https://github.com/composer/composer/commit/c50b1efd13ebd73f6dca19b31424c5a02bf93cc1","https://github.com/composer/composer/releases/tag/2.10.2","https://github.com/composer/composer/releases/tag/2.2.29","https://github.com/composer/composer/security/advisories/GHSA-499r-g7pc-vmp9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59948.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59948.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59948.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59948.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-59948.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7d01bbca5f964bd983cd04a1a88d27be22835eea/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59948.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7d01bbca5f964bd983cd04a1a88d27be22835eea/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59948.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59948.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/c7d5dce5040792ac66f5f987fd2ed030b45edce8/reports/2026-07-08/TIER_3_CVE-2026-59948.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-599xx/CVE-2026-59948.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0877.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0875","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0875.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59947","title":"Composer 调试日志凭据泄露漏洞","description":"Composer（PHP 依赖管理器）在调试日志输出中存在敏感信息泄露漏洞。当以 -vvv（调试详细级别）运行时，内嵌在仓库或包 URL 用户名位置中的凭据（如 GitHub 个人访问令牌，格式为 https://TOKEN@host/）会以明文形式输出到调试日志中。此前 Composer 已对 URL 中的密码部分进行脱敏处理，但用户名部分未做处理，导致嵌入在用户名位置的令牌被完整记录。该漏洞仅影响满足以下所有条件的场景：凭据直接嵌入在 composer.json 的 repositories 条目或包 dist/source URL 中（而非通过 auth.json 或 COMPOSER_AUTH 环境变量提供），且 Composer 以 -vvv 级别运行，调试输出被保留或分享（如公开 CI 构建日志、粘贴到 issue 或聊天中的输出、存档的终端会话等）。攻击者若能获取这些调试日志，即可窃取 GitHub 个人访问令牌等敏感凭据，进而访问受保护的代码仓库。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 4.7，危害等级中危，已在 Composer 2.2.29 和 2.10.2 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59947","GHSA-g6xq-892h-64w3"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T20:16:59Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:10:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 Composer 至 2.10.2 或 2.2.29 及以上版本，该漏洞已在上述版本中修复。如无法立即升级，避免在输出会被捕获或共享的环境中使用 -vvv 调试模式运行 Composer，并将凭据从 URL 中移出至 auth.json 或 COMPOSER_AUTH 环境变量管理，同时检查并清理可能已泄露令牌的 CI 构建日志。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/composer/composer/commit/6bd66874ae523ecb69aca5964487a0cdfda03ef8","https://github.com/composer/composer/commit/8887ad76fbd830cb1861a2b1fd8ead78ed1fa1ec","https://github.com/composer/composer/releases/tag/2.10.2","https://github.com/composer/composer/releases/tag/2.2.29","https://github.com/composer/composer/security/advisories/GHSA-g6xq-892h-64w3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59947.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59947.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59947.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59947.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-59947.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7d01bbca5f964bd983cd04a1a88d27be22835eea/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59947.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7d01bbca5f964bd983cd04a1a88d27be22835eea/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59947.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59947.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-599xx/CVE-2026-59947.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-59947.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0875.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0872","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0872.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59946","title":"Composer 包 bin 字段路径遍历漏洞","description":"Composer（PHP 依赖管理器）在处理包的 composer.json 中 bin 字段时存在路径遍历漏洞。恶意包可在 bin 条目中插入 .. 路径段，使路径解析到包安装目录之外的主机文件。当执行 composer install、update 或 require 时，Composer 会对该文件执行 chmod 操作，将其权限修改为全局可读可执行（0755）。攻击条件为项目依赖了不可信的恶意包（包括传递依赖），且目标主机上存在依赖权限保护的文件（如 SSH 私钥、.env 文件、AWS 凭证等）。该漏洞影响机密性，可使同一主机上的其他用户读取本应受限的敏感文件。--no-scripts 和 --no-plugins 等配置无法阻止此行为。Composer 2.2.29 和 2.10.2 版本已修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59946","GHSA-gjfg-22fp-rrxx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T20:16:59Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:14:18Z","remediation":"立即将 Composer 升级至 2.2.29（2.2 LTS 分支）或 2.10.2（当前 2.x 分支）及以上版本，升级命令：`composer self-update --update-keys` 后执行 `composer self-update 2.10.2`。Composer 1.x 已停止维护，须迁移至 2.x 分支。该漏洞无配置缓解措施，升级是唯一修复方案。如使用 CI/CD 流水线，请确保基础镜像中 Composer 版本已更新至修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/composer/composer/commit/502c6c4f699802d9cf464728b3e8a95674f919a0","https://github.com/composer/composer/commit/c50b1efd13ebd73f6dca19b31424c5a02bf93cc1","https://github.com/composer/composer/releases/tag/2.10.2","https://github.com/composer/composer/releases/tag/2.2.29","https://github.com/composer/composer/security/advisories/GHSA-gjfg-22fp-rrxx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59946.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66d1812e8a3da670e7f0e03b721b33c3bf9d2035/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59946.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59946.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6d30197c1ae0e0b416414f6f0ed16544575a73f/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59946.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/152c4988e6630edbe300b2d9554f35d9c7963812/data/2026/CVE-2026-59946.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7d01bbca5f964bd983cd04a1a88d27be22835eea/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59946.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7d01bbca5f964bd983cd04a1a88d27be22835eea/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59946.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59946.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-599xx/CVE-2026-59946.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/7c77ebcc357386c71db522f18fa574b7642f74e0/data/anchore/2026/CVE-2026-59946.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0872.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0599","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0599.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-55404","title":"yt-dlp 快捷链接文件命令注入漏洞","description":"yt-dlp 和 youtube-dlp 命令行音视频下载工具中，--write-link、--write-url-link 和 --write-desktop-link 选项在生成 .url 或 .desktop 快捷方式文件时，未对从元数据中提取的 webpage_url 和 filename 字段进行充分验证与转义。攻击者可构造恶意元数据载荷，在 Windows 平台注入 file:// 协议 URI 指向远程可执行文件，或在 Linux 平台通过换行符注入修改桌面条目类型为 Application 并嵌入任意 shell 命令。用户若双击执行生成的快捷方式文件，将导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 yt-dlp 2026.07.04 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-55404","GHSA-6v4j-43gg-vj32"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T20:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-13T17:01:13Z","remediation":"立即升级 yt-dlp 至 2026.07.04 或更高版本，该版本已对 --write-link 输出的 URL scheme 进行校验并对 .desktop 文件中的条目值进行转义处理。如无法升级，避免使用 --write-link、--write-url-link 和 --write-desktop-link 选项，并确保不使用 --no-windows-filenames 参数以保留默认文件名净化功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/commit/b6590aaa1e3808155d69c9a79a797ae484163789","https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/releases/tag/2026.07.04","https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/security/advisories/GHSA-6v4j-43gg-vj32","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/933422a5f82611777877a3549b9b8e3c7d70117d/cves/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55404.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7fb6b5b3f877cb85d43b44481d8426d9d97694f8/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-55404.json","https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/blob/fdcc954df4955267ec1627cbeb347b661a110e7c/devscripts/changelog_override.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/7dd233fee5478e00f4ef27fbd6512a0d682c777d/pypi/yt-dlp/CVE-2026-55404.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-55404","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/575eefe00f82443f5f87947d8e6e0e475795a92e/reports/2026-07-08/TIER_3_CVE-2026-55404.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1d7afb428742628d991f2465e712a059beb8d79/2026/55xxx/CVE-2026-55404.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/c3dfdc2468cdb0a89c10a40e310466fb77d5febc/content/posts/cve-2026-55404.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2026-55404.md","https://github.com/stemdeckapp/stemdeck/blob/655b0d0e9548c04c98d2abf4e3d68494e375d83a/pyproject.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0599.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0421","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0421.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-53624","title":"GoFiber Fiber 中间件 HSTS 标头未设置漏洞","description":"GoFiber Fiber 框架的 helmet 中间件存在安全配置错误漏洞，由于 middleware/helmet/helmet.go 第67行错误地使用 c.Protocol() 替代 c.Scheme() 来判断 HTTPS 连接，导致 Strict-Transport-Security (HSTS) 响应头永远不会被设置。该漏洞影响所有使用 helmet 中间件并配置了 HSTSMaxAge > 0 的 GoFiber 应用，攻击者可通过中间人攻击将 HTTPS 连接降级为 HTTP，从而窃取敏感信息或会话 Cookie。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-53624","GHSA-gv83-gqw6-9j2c"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T20:16:52Z","updated":"2026-07-15T20:49:42Z","remediation":"立即将 gofiber/fiber 升级到 v3.4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 helmet 中间件中 c.Protocol() 与 c.Scheme() 混淆的问题。若无法立即升级，可临时在反向代理层（如 Nginx/Traefik）强制添加 Strict-Transport-Security 响应头作为缓解措施。修复方法：将 middleware/helmet/helmet.go 第 67 行的 c.Protocol() == \"https\" 替换为 c.Scheme() == \"https\"，确保 HSTS 头在 TLS 连接下正确设置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/commit/04dd4e7754f61768fddccacc79057e416f13e6bf","https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/4389","https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/releases/tag/v3.4.0","https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/security/advisories/GHSA-gv83-gqw6-9j2c","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53624.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/0873a8ca49043e1039aea3fb7f68d46c50a10ce2/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-53624.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/3b63910ae4e1e9b72167345f63d9f5750b50ec5a/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-53624","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5c50b42f02438e6d2727eef5fecc301070143fae/2026/53xxx/CVE-2026-53624.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/go/github.com/gofiber/fiber/CVE-2026-53624.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/b2967c74374787d2c3ce14ea33111cd90ca3f359/content/posts/cve-2026-53624.md","https://github.com/golang/vulndb/blob/d246ad98d3739cece1ce57358766d7c340b09c91/data/reports/GO-2026-5912.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-53624.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/30b2e88d407156e5425e05ff25f0ec9537280e2f/advisories/github-reviewed/2026/07/GHSA-gv83-gqw6-9j2c/GHSA-gv83-gqw6-9j2c.json","https://github.com/anchore/vulnerability-index-spec-files/blob/124f9dd88ae3210967065ab152ac9debdc2e3709/data/2026/46/ANCHORE-2026-46929.toml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0421.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0270","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0270.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-44512","title":"ONNX 版本转换器上采样适配器空指针解引用漏洞","description":"ONNX（Open Neural Network Exchange）机器学习模型互操作框架的版本转换器适配器存在空指针解引用漏洞（CWE-476）。当 `convert_version()` 函数处理包含零输入（zero inputs）的 Upsample 算子的恶意模型时，`Upsample_6_7::adapt_upsample_6_7()` 在 `onnx/version_converter/adapters/upsample_6_7.h:31` 行直接访问 `node->inputs()[0]->sizes()` 而未检查输入数量，导致空指针解引用和程序崩溃（SIGSEGV），造成拒绝服务。攻击者可构造 107 字节的 PoC 模型文件触发该漏洞。该漏洞影响 ONNX 1.9.0 至 1.22.0 之前版本，1.22.0 版本已修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-44512","GHSA-hwpq-hmq9-wj77"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T20:16:49Z","updated":"2026-07-13T17:02:01Z","remediation":"升级 ONNX 至 1.22.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Upsample 版本转换器适配器中未检查输入数量即访问 `node->inputs()[0]->sizes()` 导致的空指针解引用问题。如无法立即升级，可在调用 `convert_version()` 前对输入模型进行校验，确保 Upsample 节点输入数量大于 0，或使用沙箱环境隔离不可信模型的转换操作作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/onnx/onnx/commit/cd310408165ad47c3cd7eb2b86cb5b80aa2e4fdf","https://github.com/onnx/onnx/pull/7813","https://github.com/onnx/onnx/releases/tag/v1.22.0","https://github.com/onnx/onnx/security/advisories/GHSA-hwpq-hmq9-wj77","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2026/CVE-2026-44512.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/362345baaa3b0376b2369a7901885756e250334b/cves/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44512.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-44512.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/onnx/CVE-2026-44512.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/b3554c3c2bf0f2c12989d1d265a8595d25100129/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-44512","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3e6800281dab3089a8374b9fe419c8b8110ea36/2026/44xxx/CVE-2026-44512.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/57037e9ca1e585082424bbd15c12a674807d0c21/content/posts/cve-2026-44512.md","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/9a0b7a19487f40b2e217de2ad9f19cbcad032a8a/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-44512.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2026.txt","https://github.com/pypa/advisory-database/blob/aad1d5d7fcfd4bf7bee792090d157de726946a96/vulns/onnx/PYSEC-2026-2689.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0270.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0870","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0870.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59929","title":"Mistune Markdown 解析器 URL 方案过滤绕过导致跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Mistune 是一款 Python Markdown 解析器，其 HTML 渲染器中的 `safe_url` 函数采用黑名单机制过滤危险 URL 协议，但仅拦截了 `javascript:`、`vbscript:`、`file:` 和 `data:` 四种协议，遗漏了 `feed:`、`view-source:`、`jar:`、`livescript:`、`mocha:`、`ms-its:`、`mk:` 和 `res:` 等历史遗留或可链式调用的协议。攻击者可在用户可控的 Markdown 内容中构造如 `feed:javascript:alert(1)` 的链接，当使用旧版 Firefox、Internet Explorer、Edge Legacy 或注册了自定义协议处理器的浏览器用户点击该链接时，链式协议会触发 JavaScript 执行，导致跨站脚本攻击（XSS），可窃取用户会话 Cookie 或冒充用户执行操作。该漏洞影响 3.3.0 之前的所有版本，攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59929","GHSA-qfrw-5rxm-mhh2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:28Z","updated":"2026-07-09T19:29:01Z","remediation":"立即将 mistune 升级至 3.3.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade mistune`），该版本已将 URL 协议校验从黑名单模式改为白名单模式，仅允许 http:/https:/mailto: 等安全协议。如无法升级，可在应用层对所有用户输入的 Markdown 链接进行二次过滤，在渲染前检查 href 中是否包含非白名单协议前缀。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/commit/c7101fcbb6e8790e8e39157c5ca2238fc6dd6cbc","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/releases/tag/v3.3.0","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-qfrw-5rxm-mhh2","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59929.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ca27d016571e65b8b794044c0722f4842d8c02cb/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59929.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/23f497cfa900b1c0908e9aaab11ef4e5e9bc8af3/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59929.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/0adbd05f9f410c2b26d550d344ac019efa6b7224/pkgs/development/python-modules/mistune/2.nix","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be58e0e3c542843372e0883fccedcf7e869f2994/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59929.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be58e0e3c542843372e0883fccedcf7e869f2994/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59929.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59929.md","https://github.com/Agent-Threat-Rule/agent-threat-rules/blob/cca73291c848f1516df94bc28cf2f26750f6054a/proposals/jvn/CVE-2026-59929.proposal.yaml","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59929.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59929.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0870.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0869","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0869.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59928","title":"Mistune Markdown 解析器 时间复杂度攻击漏洞","description":"Mistune Python Markdown 解析器的 block_parser.py 中存在算法复杂度缺陷，在处理大量重复或不同的参考链接定义时，解析时间呈二次方增长（O(N²)）。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过提交包含大量重复参考链接定义的恶意 Markdown 文档（如 5000 个 [a]: u\\n 定义耗时约 1.1 秒，10000 个约 4.5 秒），导致目标系统 CPU 资源耗尽，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Mistune 3.3.0 之前的所有版本，已在 3.3.0 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59928","GHSA-ffq3-xpv3-j92q"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:28Z","updated":"2026-07-09T19:29:34Z","remediation":"立即将 mistune 升级至 3.3.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade mistune`）。如无法升级，在调用 `mistune.create_markdown()` 前对用户输入的 Markdown 文档大小进行限制（建议不超过 10KB），并设置超时时间（如 2 秒）以防止 CPU 耗尽。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/commit/2b04d7ba341c16ac78fe82d3076bdd5c3de87c69","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/releases/tag/v3.3.0","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-ffq3-xpv3-j92q","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59928.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59928.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66c0b846661d24b6c0080f2afee2bfee1abc93b1/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59928.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/ae793fd9edc1006a0277f521a5c2e41b467086de/pkgs/development/python-modules/mistune/2.nix","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59928.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59928.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59928.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59928.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59928.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59928.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0869.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0869.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0868","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0868.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59927","title":"Mistune Markdown 解析器 Include 指令相互递归包含拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mistune 是一款 Python Markdown 解析器，其 Include 指令在检测文件包含循环时仅检查直接自引用（即 a.md 不能包含自身），但未检测间接循环引用。攻击者可通过上传两个相互包含的 Markdown 文件（如 a.md 包含 b.md，b.md 包含 a.md），触发无限制递归调用，导致 Python 栈溢出并抛出 RecursionError，最终使渲染进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Mistune 3.3.0 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，仅需具备上传 Markdown 文件的权限。官方已在 3.3.0 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59927","GHSA-8mpj-m6qm-5qr8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:28Z","updated":"2026-07-09T19:30:14Z","remediation":"升级 Mistune 至 3.3.0 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade mistune）。如无法立即升级，可在应用中禁用 Include 指令（移除 RSTDirective([Include()]) 插件注册），或在使用前对用户上传的 Markdown 文件进行循环引用检测。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/commit/1bef343ade163fc3bb95572b15be720084cdb993","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/releases/tag/v3.3.0","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-8mpj-m6qm-5qr8","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59927.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66c0b846661d24b6c0080f2afee2bfee1abc93b1/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59927.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/3838d44e3436a251174e5377e8206e2f63e59762/pkgs/development/python-modules/mistune/2.nix","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59927.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59927.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59927.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59927.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59927.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59927.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/9af727c40ac027294e4558abbc02d8967ee2a1d7/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-599xx/CVE-2026-59927.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0868.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0867","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0867.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59926","title":"Mistune Admonition 指令未转义类选项跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Mistune Python Markdown 解析器的 Admonition 指令中存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。在 `src/mistune/directives/admonition.py` 的 `render_admonition()` 函数中，`:class:` 选项的值未经转义直接拼接至 HTML class 属性中，导致即使启用了 `HTMLRenderer(escape=True)` 安全模式，攻击者仍可通过构造恶意的 class 参数注入任意 HTML 属性或 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞影响 Mistune 3.2.1 之前的所有版本，攻击者无需身份认证，仅需诱使用户解析包含恶意 Admonition 指令的 Markdown 内容即可触发，属于低交互低权限的存储型/反射型 XSS 攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59926","GHSA-g97x-gvcm-x72h"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:28Z","updated":"2026-07-09T19:38:07Z","remediation":"立即将 mistune 升级至 3.2.1 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade mistune）。如无法升级，在调用 Admonition 指令前对 :class: 参数值进行 HTML 转义处理，或禁用 Admonition 扩展作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/commit/a3cb6e5655308797e8be021d6c7b5bab13cbace2","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/releases/tag/v3.2.1","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-g97x-gvcm-x72h","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/c6e3b04088d3a34fb448e0c7ffd377395dcc3ef8/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59926.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66c0b846661d24b6c0080f2afee2bfee1abc93b1/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59926.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/3838d44e3436a251174e5377e8206e2f63e59762/pkgs/development/python-modules/mistune/2.nix","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59926.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59926.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59926.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59926.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59926.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/pypi/mistune/CVE-2026-59926.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/17667b5495f12f52eeccac23e3922067b089ebc4/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2026-59926"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0867.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0866","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0866.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59925","title":"Mistune Markdown 解析器强调语法解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mistune Python Markdown 解析器在核心强调语法解析中存在算法复杂度漏洞（CWE-407）。默认配置下，解析器在处理长序列的 `**x**`（加粗）或 `***x***`（加粗+斜体）强调对时，会从每个潜在起始位置向前扫描匹配的结束标记，导致解析时间复杂度达到 O(N²)。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过提交 40KB 的恶意 Markdown 文本触发该漏洞，使服务器 CPU 占用率飙升（8000 次重复约 4.3 秒），结合并发请求可造成服务拒绝。该漏洞影响 Mistune 3.3.0 之前的所有版本，无需任何插件即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59925","GHSA-4j32-57v6-6g45"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:28Z","updated":"2026-07-09T19:39:58Z","remediation":"升级 mistune 至 3.3.0 或更高版本（`pip install --upgrade mistune`）。如无法立即升级，可在调用 `mistune.create_markdown()` 前对用户输入长度设置上限（如限制输入不超过 10KB），或使用 CommonMark 兼容解析器（如 markdown-it-py）替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/commit/5de41fb8e527004dbc363e047a3c380c9288c74f","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/releases/tag/v3.3.0","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-4j32-57v6-6g45","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59925.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59925.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/66c0b846661d24b6c0080f2afee2bfee1abc93b1/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59925.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/49b2c5889e5d100ed5e25424b3972aae903b3bc6/pkgs/development/python-modules/mistune/2.nix","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59925.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6e8a79e44f6fbd3ac137885a8646f81e8e0c401a/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59925.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59925.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59925.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59925.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59925.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0866.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0865","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0865.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59924","title":"Mistune mistune Include指令路径遍历漏洞","description":"Mistune 是一个 Python Markdown 解析库，其 Include 指令的 parse() 方法在处理用户提供的包含路径时，仅通过 os.path.join 和 os.path.normpath 进行拼接与规范化，未对最终解析路径是否仍在预期的 Markdown 目录范围内进行校验，存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22）。攻击者可通过在 Markdown 文件中构造包含 ../ 等路径遍历序列的 include 指令，诱使应用使用 md.read() 处理该文件，从而读取目标系统上任意文件。该漏洞影响 Mistune 3.3.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 5.9，危害等级中危。建议升级至 v3.3.0 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59924","GHSA-r4rv-85jg-w4mf"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:28Z","updated":"2026-07-09T19:34:54Z","remediation":"立即将 mistune 升级至 3.3.0 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade mistune>=3.3.0）。如无法升级，在调用 Include() 时对用户传入的路径进行校验，使用 os.path.realpath 解析后判断是否在允许的基准目录内，或禁用 RSTDirective([Include()]) 插件。避免直接处理不可信的 Markdown 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/commit/1bef343ade163fc3bb95572b15be720084cdb993","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/releases/tag/v3.3.0","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-r4rv-85jg-w4mf","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59924.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59924.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/46b7c8ac8c997aaed3114f5023cf6f92bef0e4cb/pkgs/development/python-modules/mistune/2.nix","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59924.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59924.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59924.md","https://github.com/0x5t4l1n/CVE/blob/43b830872cd58bf494fcb71f296f05ca935397e8/reported/CVE-2026-59924.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59924.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59924.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59924.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0865.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0864","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0864.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59923","title":"Mistune Python Markdown解析器跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Mistune（Python Markdown 解析器）的 HTMLRenderer.safe_url() 函数存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该函数旨在通过检查 URL 前缀来拦截 javascript: 等危险协议，但在进行协议检查前未对输入 URL 进行 URL 解码。远程攻击者可通过构造包含百分号编码的 javascript URI（如 javascript%3Aalert(1)）的恶意 Markdown 链接或图片，绕过 safe_url() 的安全过滤。当受害者点击该链接时，浏览器会自动解码 %3A 为 :，导致任意 JavaScript 代码在受害者浏览器上下文中执行。攻击者可利用此漏洞窃取会话 Cookie、执行任意脚本，甚至实现账户接管。该漏洞影响 Mistune 3.3.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。用户需升级至 3.3.0 或更高版本修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59923","GHSA-8c25-4j27-2rv3"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:27Z","updated":"2026-07-09T19:35:14Z","remediation":"立即将 mistune 升级至 3.3.0 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade mistune）。如无法升级，在调用 mistune 渲染前对用户输入的 Markdown 内容中的 URL 进行额外解码校验，过滤包含 javascript: 等危险协议的链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/commit/c7101fcbb6e8790e8e39157c5ca2238fc6dd6cbc","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/releases/tag/v3.3.0","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-8c25-4j27-2rv3","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59923.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59923.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59923.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/46b7c8ac8c997aaed3114f5023cf6f92bef0e4cb/pkgs/development/python-modules/mistune/2.nix","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59923.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59923.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59923.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59923.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/da023dce15afda23b7bf638f731a48ca302e5f09/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59923.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59923.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0864.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0864.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0863","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0863.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59922","title":"Mistune Markdown 解析器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Mistune 是一款 Python Markdown 解析器，其格式化插件（strikethrough/删除线、mark/标记、insert/插入）在处理连续闭合标记对（如 `~~x~~`、`==x==`、`^^x^^`）时存在算法复杂度缺陷。攻击者无需认证即可通过网络向启用了上述插件的应用提交特制的 Markdown 载荷，由于解析器在每个可能的起始位置均执行前向扫描匹配闭合标记，导致时间复杂度为 O(N²)，8KB 输入即可使 CPU 占用约 4 秒，16KB 输入约 17 秒，造成服务拒绝。该漏洞影响启用了 strikethrough、mark 或 insert 插件的所有 Mistune 版本（低于 3.3.0），CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 3.3.0 版本中通过限制并发追踪的未匹配标记数量修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59922","GHSA-c8j7-8cv4-2xmq"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:27Z","updated":"2026-07-09T19:36:00Z","remediation":"立即将 mistune 升级至 3.3.0 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade mistune）。如无法升级，在调用 create_markdown() 时移除 strikethrough、mark、insert 插件，或对用户输入的 Markdown 长度限制在 4KB 以内并设置 CPU 超时（如 2 秒）作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/lepture/mistune/commit/96d0f57f8fe9eeb06bb4cff521962a27d7c402e7","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/releases/tag/v3.3.0","https://github.com/lepture/mistune/security/advisories/GHSA-c8j7-8cv4-2xmq","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2026/CVE-2026-59922.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a31aa101497b2d23391e84ef31f75e6600381dae/cves/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59922.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bbff37eeafd64310b94d439a5f7493406fcdc115/2026/59xxx/CVE-2026-59922.json","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/39e826aec21b0c6931bac5384dbc50eb182369bf/pkgs/development/python-modules/mistune/2.nix","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-59922.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be7c9eef0523e112dce5fde0006bf85d14a40618/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-59922.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/35f8822ad3b850cb8a922d9066b0d79c83dab6d5/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-59922.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/vex/cve/2026/CVE-2026-59922.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2026/UBUNTU-CVE-2026-59922.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-59922.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0863.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0863.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0862","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0862.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-59897","title":"Hono AWS API Gateway v1 适配器重复请求头值去重绕过漏洞","description":"Hono Web 应用框架的 AWS API Gateway v1 适配器存在请求头去重逻辑缺陷，该适配器在去重重复请求头时使用子串比较而非精确匹配，导致同一请求头中一个值为另一个值的子串时（如 `203.0.113.1` 被 `203.0.113.10` 覆盖）会被错误丢弃。攻击者可构造特制的重复请求头值，使中间件或应用逻辑（如基于 `X-Forwarded-For` 链的 IP 限制、速率限制、审计日志或代理链验证）接收到不完整数据，从而绕过安全决策。该漏洞影响 Hono 4.3.3 至 4.12.27 版本，需攻击者具备向目标应用发送 HTTP 请求的能力，攻击复杂度较高。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-59897","GHSA-xgm2-5f3f-mvvc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-08T17:17:27Z","updated":"2026-07-10T19:50:16Z","remediation":"立即将 Hono 框架升级至 v4.12.27 或更高版本（npm update hono），该版本已修复 AWS API Gateway v1 适配器中重复请求头值去重时的子串比较问题。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对 X-Forwarded-For 等关键重复头部的值列表做独立校验，避免依赖适配器去重后的结果。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/honojs/hono/commit/aa921770d09bc35970362d5a2630a878f6d982fd","